01:48:06,031 --> 01:48:07,196
Mãe

743
01:48:08,322 --> 01:48:10,652
Precisa de algo?

744
01:49:20,874 --> 01:49:22,672
"Querida Matilde:

745
01:49:22,773 --> 01:49:25,770
